<article class="env-lemma" id="0DFA">
  <p><a class="environment-identifier" href="/tag/0DFA">Lemma <span data-tag="0DFA">73.5.2</span>.</a> Any étale covering is a smooth covering, and a fortiori, any Zariski covering is a smooth covering. </p>
</article><article class="env-proof">
    <p>
      <strong>Proof.</strong>
      This is clear from the definitions, the fact that an étale morphism is smooth (Morphisms of Spaces, Lemma <a href="/tag/04XX" data-tag="04XX">67.39.6</a>), and Lemma <a href="/tag/0DF1" data-tag="0DF1">73.4.2</a>. 
      <span class="qed">$\square$</span>
    </p>
</article>